1
00:00:09,884 --> 00:00:12,137
Unbelievable!
The Knights have

2
00:00:12,137 --> 00:00:13,972
tied it up in
the final quarter!

3
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:15,223
Can they pull off
another miracle?

4
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:24,149
Ted!

5
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:26,443
This time,

6
00:00:26,443 --> 00:00:27,569
I'll take home
the trophy!

7
00:00:27,986 --> 00:00:29,029
There's only
one minute left.

8
00:00:29,404 --> 00:00:30,488
Ted's got the ball!

9
00:00:30,488 --> 00:00:32,115
He is leading
the offense!

10
00:00:32,407 --> 00:00:33,199
Stop him!

11
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:35,035
If you lose this game,
you're all done!

12
00:00:36,911 --> 00:00:38,830
Ted throws it, but
there's no one there

13
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:39,456
to catch it.

14
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:40,915
It looks like
a ghost town

15
00:00:40,915 --> 00:00:41,916
on that side
of the field.

16
00:00:42,917 --> 00:00:44,335
Looks like they gave up
on that play.

17
00:00:44,753 --> 00:00:46,212
See? I told you.

18
00:00:46,337 --> 00:00:47,088
Ted can't win.

19
00:00:47,589 --> 00:00:48,673
We'll drag this
into overtime

20
00:00:48,673 --> 00:00:50,592
and then we'll
crush him then.

21
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:51,468
Alright.

22
00:01:01,936 --> 00:01:02,604
Yes!

23
00:01:03,313 --> 00:01:05,815
Hail Mary! My God!

24
00:01:05,815 --> 00:01:08,359
Ted just pulled off
a game-winning.

25
00:01:08,359 --> 00:01:09,819
Hail Mary!
